=== 2.7 로트 이력·커머낼리티 분석 절차

```text
  bad lots (N_b)  +  good lots (N_g), same product, same period
        |
        v
  for each process step s:
     for each tool/chamber/slot/recipe/consumable value v:
        count bad lots with v  (b_v)   vs   good lots with v (g_v)
        ratio = (b_v / N_b) / (g_v / N_g)     <- enrichment vs base rate
        p     = Fisher exact test on 2x2 table
        |
        v
  rank by (ratio, p), filter ratio > 2 and p < 0.01
        |
        v
  cross-check: is the top hit confounded with another top hit?
  (same time window? same product mix? same slot pattern?)
        |
        v
  align with change-point date: PM log, consumable swap, recipe version, PCN
```

